<div class="a-row a-spacing-none"> <div class="a-column a-span12 a-text-right a-span-last"> <i id="attach-warranty-close-icon" class="a-icon a-icon-close a-icon-medium" role="presentation"></i> </div> </div>  <div id="attach-warranty-display" class="a-section"> <input type="hidden" name="" value="B0BVQHFR7T" id="attach-warranty-asin">  <h1 id="attach-warranty-header" class="a-size-medium a-spacing-none a-color-base a-text-center"> Add to your order </h1> <hr id="attach-warranty-divider" aria-hidden="true" class="a-spacing-base a-spacing-top-small a-divider-normal"> <div class="a-row a-spacing-micro"> <div class="a-column a-span2"> <img alt="" src="./BOSCH-GBL-82-270-Professional-Blower_files/51CgV-DfIiL._SL75_.jpg" class="attach-accessory-image" id="attach-sheet-warranty-image"> </div> <div class="a-column a-span10 a-span-last"> <a class="a-size-large a-color-base a-spacing-micro a-link-normal" target="_blank" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0BVQHFR7T/ref=dp_atch_dss_w_lm_B07N11YYWR_B0BVQHFR7T"> <span id="attach-warranty-displayTitle" class="a-text-bold"> Onsitego 1 Year Extended Warranty for Small Home &amp; Kitchen Appliances from Rs. 5001-6000 (Email Delivery - No Physical Kit) </span> </a> <br> <span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary"> from  Onsite Electro Services Private Limited </span>  <div class="a-icon-row a-spacing-micro">   <a aria-label="4.0 out of 5 stars" class="a-link-normal" target="_blank" href="https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0BVQHFR7T/ref=dp_atch_dss_w_r_B07N11YYWR_B0BVQHFR7T?ie=UTF8&amp;showViewpoints=1"> <i class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-4"></i> </a> <a aria-label="424 Customer Reviews" class="a-link-normal" target="_blank" href="https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0BVQHFR7T/ref=dp_atch_dss_w_r_B07N11YYWR_B0BVQHFR7T?ie=UTF8&amp;showViewpoints=1"> 424 </a> </div>  <span class="a-size-large a-color-base attach-warranty-price attach-accessory-price-warranty"> ₹489.00 </span> <input type="hidden" name="asin." value="B0BVQHFR7T">
        <input type="hidden" name="strikethroughAsin." value="">
            </div> </div> <div class="a-row"> <div class="a-column a-span8"> <div class="a-row a-spacing-micro"> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">EMAIL DELIVERY ONLY: Download your extended warranty certificate by sharing your device details. The link is available under buyer/seller messages at www.amazon.in/msg and is also sent to your Amazon registered email ID</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">REPAIR OR REPLACEMENT GUARANTEE: We will either repair your device or give a replacement. The replacement device will be provided at the discretion of Onsitego on the basis of the depreciated value of your device</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">HASSLE-FREE SERVICE: ‘No Questions Asked’ Repair Policy | Zero-Paperwork Claims Process | Free Pick &amp; Drop or At-Home Service</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">LIMIT OF LIABILITY: Onsitego liability is limited to the depreciated value of the device as detailed in our T&amp;C document</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">HIGH-QUALITY REPAIRS: Service by Onsitego authorised service engineers with high-quality spare parts every single time.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">EASY TO REQUEST SERVICE: Download the Onsitego app to raise a repair request within 10 seconds or visit our website. You can also call us or chat with us on 99205 99206</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">COVERAGE: The plan covers all defects &amp; malfunctions under the original manufacturer’s warranty. The plan starts the day after the manufacturer’s warranty ends or on the 366th day from the date of device purchase, whichever is later. It does not cover physical or liquid damage, accessories, preventive maintenance or consumables. It also does not cover parts that are not covered under the standard manufacturer’s warranty</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">ELIGIBILITY: The plan can be purchased only for new devices bought on the Amazon platform and WITHIN 30 days of device purchase or before the expiration of the manufacturer's warranty, whichever occurs first. You can purchase this plan only for devices that have AT LEAST 1 Authorised Service Centre anywhere in India. The sum of the manufacturer’s warranty and extended warranty CANNOT EXCEED 5 YEARS. This plan does not cover products or devices purchased or used for COMMERCIAL purposes</span></li>  </ul> </div> </div> <div class="a-column a-span4 a-span-last"> <div class="a-box a-spacing-base a-color-alternate-background"><div class="a-box-inner"> <div class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden attach_add_accessory_alert_warranty attach_add_accessory_alert" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content"> <span class="a-size-base a-color-success"> Added to cart </span> </div></div></div> <div class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-error aok-hidden attach_add_accessory_alert attach_add_accessory_error_warranty" role="alert"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content"> <span class="a-size-base"> An error occurred when processing your request. </span> <a class="a-link-normal attach-add-to-cart-retry" href="https://www.amazon.in/GBL-Professional-Volumetric-Compatible-Attachments/dp/B07N11YYWR/ref=sr_1_1?adgrpid=168772406052&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.CEJ0zlvH-NB9RSOICG6Kr7n_2gar5AEkIYX0FJZGnWIQqCCgUtS1gpMzwGbcYn7GWyKBVFTUzS3b7QTbOifPrhuklVPyEJohyCpPKi8iyQzT0-V8lWdbtnekHhx2idImPK9TJuca0uPpdAA2JVokHz_CzmKvH50lJ2C1v4IconeU-5wygeKR1OG6-P7-vCGsFDn-gVFpTf0PtWRQLIQXRxo3SPciYeSoFAjcp8kQzlU.vzVxIZAeQtkaOfWfs2TjupXnKu_6YkApJHnyPB_Ks1E&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;gad_source=1&amp;hvadid=779192580461&amp;hvdev=c&amp;hvexpln=0&amp;hvlocphy=9062015&amp;hvnetw=g&amp;hvocijid=10575122398740656652--&amp;hvqmt=b&amp;hvrand=10575122398740656652&amp;hvtargid=kwd-2261998702540&amp;hydadcr=9250_23