                                 <div id="featurebullets_feature_div" class="celwidget" data-feature-name="featurebullets_nonPets" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-content-id="featurebullets_nonPets" data-csa-c-slot-id="featurebullets_feature_div" data-csa-c-asin="B07N11YYWR" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row="false" data-csa-c-id="7lv9r9-z4cgo5-netbgz-ypfp2w" data-cel-widget="featurebullets_feature_div">
                                 <div id="feature-bullets" class="a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small">               <hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-divider-normal">    <h2 class="a-size-base-plus a-text-bold"> About this item </h2>                  <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini">  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Powerful 820W Motor for Efficient Blowing: The BOSCH GBL 82-270 Professional Blower features an 820 W rated input motor, delivering high performance for effective dust collection and blowing duties. Its sturdy motor guarantees longevity and steady operation, making it suitable for challenging work conditions.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Strong Air Flow: This multifunctional GBL 82-270 tool is ideal for both blowing and dust collection, offering the strongest airflow to enhance work productivity. The large air volume ensures comprehensive cleaning and removal of debris, making it a vital tool for professionals requiring dependable performance.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> No-Load Speed &amp; Volumetric Flow Rate: Boasting a no-load speed of 16,000 RPM and a volumetric flow rate of 4.5 m³/min, the GBL 82-270 delivers rapid airflow for efficient dust extraction and debris clearance. These features ensure peak performance, facilitating effective work across different tasks.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Speed Pre-Selection for Material-Specific Tasks: Equipped with a speed adjustment feature, the blower allows users to modify the tool’s speed according to specific material needs. This capability guarantees optimal outcomes, rendering it appropriate for a variety of tasks in metalworking and other professional fields.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Scope of Supply: This comprehensive package includes the BOSCH GBL 82-270 Professional Blower, along with a Deep Hole Nozzle, Standard Nozzle, Extension Nozzle, Flexible Connection, and a Dust Bag.  </span></li>  </ul>   <!-- Loading EDP related metadata -->
                    <div data-csa-c-content-id="voyager-product-details-jumplink" data-csa-c-slot-id="voyager-product-details-jumplink" data-csa-c-type="link" class="a-section" data-csa-c-id="6jbtv8-w62qns-3q0rf8-9nb1jk"> <span class="caretnext">›</span> <a id="seeMoreDetailsLink" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/GBL-Professional-Volumetric-Compatible-Attachments/dp/B07N11YYWR/ref=sr_1_1?adgrpid=168772406052&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.CEJ0zlvH-NB9RSOICG6Kr7n_2gar5AEkIYX0FJZGnWIQqCCgUtS1gpMzwGbcYn7GWyKBVFTUzS3b7QTbOifPrhuklVPyEJohyCpPKi8iyQzT0-V8lWdbtnekHhx2idImPK9TJuca0uPpdAA2JVokHz_CzmKvH50lJ2C1v4IconeU-5wygeKR1OG6-P7-vCGsFDn-gVFpTf0PtWRQLIQXRxo3SPciYeSoFAjcp8kQzlU.vzVxIZAeQtkaOfWfs2TjupXnKu_6YkApJHnyPB_Ks1E&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;gad_source=1&amp;hvadid=779192580461&amp;hvdev=c&amp;hvexpln=0&amp;hvlocphy=9062015&amp;hvnetw=g&amp;hvocijid=10575122398740656652--&amp;hvqmt=b&amp;hvrand=10575122398740656652&amp;hvtargid=kwd-2261998702540&amp;hydadcr=9250_2368601&amp;keywords=bosch%2Bgbl%2B82%2B270%2Bblower&amp;mcid=81af2ed7619c341cba97eeed014e5923&amp;qid=1784686266&amp;sr=8-1&amp;th=1#productDetails"> See more product details </a> </div>          </div>                               </div>
