                              <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-pqvOverlay">             <div data-cel-widget="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-content-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-slot-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-type="popup" class="a-section a-padding-none celwidget" data-csa-c-id="nhdz1u-rryqnn-4xm0aa-ixq9by">      <script type="text/javascript">(function(f) {var _np=(window.P._namespace("DetailPagePQVAssets"));if(_np.guardFatal){_np.guardFatal(f)(_np);}else{f(_np);}}(function(P) {
                P.now('pqv').execute(function(pqv) {
                    if (!pqv) {
                        P.register("pqv", function () {
                            return {
                                overlayType: 'desktop'
                            };
                        });
                    }
                });
            }));</script>         <h1 id="pqv-title"> Product Summary: BOSCH GBL 82-270 Air Blower Machine for Home, Car &amp; Workshop | 820W | 4.5 m³/min | 16000 RPM | Dust Cleaner | Multiple Nozzles | 2.25 kg | 1 Year Warranty </h1>    <p id="pqv-byline">From Bosch</p>               <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <p id="pqv-ratings" data-target="#averageCustomerReviews_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none">  4.1 out of 5 stars, 574 ratings </p> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-reviews-action" data-pqv-reviews-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-reviews" data-target="#customer-reviews_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/GBL-Professional-Volumetric-Compatible-Attachments/dp/B07N11YYWR/ref=sr_1_1?ref=dp_product_quick_view#customer-reviews_feature_div"> Customer reviews </a> </span>   <p id="pqv-bought-in-last-month" data-target="#socialProofingAsinFaceout_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none">100+ bought in past month</p>  </div>        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-price"> Price </h2>             <p class="a-spacing-small">              <span class="a-text-bold"> One-time purchase: ₹5,588.00 </span>                  4% Savings   </p>         <p id="pqv-price-list-price" data-target="#corePriceDisplay_desktop_feature_div .basisPrice" class="a-spacing-small"> List Price: <span class="a-text-strike"> ₹5,850.00 </span> </p>         <p id="pqv-price-deal-end-time" class="a-spacing-small"> Deal ends: <time class="pqv-time" datetime="1785522300000">1785522300000</time>
    </p>                                       <p id="pqv-price-vat-message" class="a-spacing-small">  Inclusive of all taxes  </p>           <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buybox-action" data-pqv-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buybox" data-target="#buybox" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/GBL-Professional-Volumetric-Compatible-Attachments/dp/B07N11YYWR/ref=sr_1_1?ref=dp_product_quick_view#buybox"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p>                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buying-options-action" data-pqv-buying-options-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buying-options" data-target="#dynamic-aod-ingress-box" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/GBL-Professional-Volumetric-Compatible-Attachments/dp/B07N11YYWR/ref=sr_1_1?ref=dp_product_quick_view#dynamic-aod-ingress-box"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-unqualified-buybox-action" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="https://www.amazon.in/GBL-Professional-Volumetric-Compatible-Attachments/dp/B07N11YYWR/ref=sr_1_1?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featurebullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">Powerful 820W Motor for Efficient Blowing: The BOSCH GBL 82-270 Professional Blower features an 820 W rated input motor, delivering high performance for effective dust collection and blowing duties. Its sturdy motor guarantees longevity and steady operation, making it suitable for challenging work conditions.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Strong Air Flow: This multifunctional GBL 82-270 tool is ideal for both blowing and dust collection, offering the strongest airflow to enhance work productivity. The large air volume ensures comprehensive cleaning and removal of debris, making it a vital tool for professionals requiring dependable performance.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">No-Load Speed &amp; Volumetric Flow Rate: Boasting a no-load speed of 16,000 RPM and a volumetric flow rate of 4.5 m³/min, the GBL 82-270 delivers rapid airflow for efficient dust extraction and debris clearance. These features ensure peak performance, facilitating effective work across different tasks.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Speed Pre-Selection for Material-Specific Tasks: Equipped with a speed adjustment feature, the blower allows users to modify the tool’s speed according to specific material needs. This capability guarantees optimal outcomes, rendering it appropriate for a variety of tasks in metalworking and other professional fields.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Scope of Supply: This comprehensive package includes the BOSCH GBL 82-270 Professional Blower, along with a Deep Hole Nozzle, Standard Nozzle, Extension Nozzle, Flexible Connection, and a Dust Bag.</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product description</h2>    <div>
                    Technical data: Input Power: 800W; No-Load Speed: 16000rpm; Flow rate: 0-4.5 m3/s; Weight: 1.8 kg. Color: Blue.  </div>
               </div>                        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-options-available">Options Available</h2>    <h3>Style Name</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> GBL 82-270 </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> GBL 620 </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> GBL 650 </span></li>  </ul>  <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-twister-action" data-pqv-twister-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-twister" data-target="#twister-plus-inline-twister,#twister" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/GBL-Professional-Volumetric-Compatible-Attachments/dp/B07N11YYWR/ref=sr_1_1?ref=dp_product_quick_view#twister"> Browse all available options </a> </span> </div>                              <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-report-issue-action" data-pqv-report-issue-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-report-issue" data-target="#tellAmazon_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/GBL-Professional-Volumetric-Compatible-Attachments/dp/B07N11YYWR/ref=sr_1_1?ref=dp_product_quick_view#tellAmazon_feature_div"> Report an issue with this product or seller </a> </span> </div>                     <div id="pqv-feedback" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feedback-heading">Feedback</h2> <p>Did you find this product summary feature useful?</p>   <div id="pqv-feedback-buttons-section" class="a-section"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-positive-action" data-pqv-feedback-positive-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-positive" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-positive-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary is useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-positive-announce"><span id="pqv-feedback-positive-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> Yes, it is useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> <div class="a-section a-padding-base"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-negative-action" data-pqv-feedback-negative-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-negative" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-negative-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary isn&#39;t useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-negative-announce"><span id="pqv-feedback-negative-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> No, it is not useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> </div> <div id="pqv-feedback-submit-section" class="a-section aok-hidden"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <div class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content" tabindex="-1"> Thank you for your feedback </div></div></div> <div id="pqv-feedback-message-positive" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content" tabindex="-1"> Thank you for your feedback. You selected “Yes, it is useful” </div></div></div> <div id="pqv-feedback-message-negative" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content" tabindex="-1"> Thank you for your feedback. You selected “No, it is not useful” </div></div></div> </div> <div class="a-section a-padding-base"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-reset-action" data-pqv-feedback-reset-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-reset" class="a-button a